<section class="sec" id="architecture">
  <div class="sec-eyebrow">Technical Stack</div>
  <div class="sec-heading">Architecture</div>
  <div class="arch-layout">
    <div class="arch-cards">
      <div class="arch-card">
        <div class="arch-card-num">01 &middot; Generative Engine</div>
        <span class="arch-card-icon">🧠</span>
        <div class="arch-card-name">Stable Diffusion v1.5</div>
        <div class="arch-card-tech">OpenVINO/stable-diffusion-v1-5-fp16-ov</div>
        <div class="arch-card-desc">Base latent diffusion model for high-fidelity iris texture synthesis. Prompted with biological domain vocabulary &mdash; pupil state, pigmentation, macro photography.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="arch-card">
        <div class="arch-card-num">02 &middot; Inference Runtime</div>
        <span class="arch-card-icon">&#9889;</span>
        <div class="arch-card-name">Intel OpenVINO&trade;</div>
        <div class="arch-card-tech">optimum-intel &middot; OVStableDiffusionPipeline</div>
        <div class="arch-card-desc">Compiles neural network layers to x86_64 IR. FP16 halves memory footprint. pipe.reshape() pins batch/resolution before compile to prevent runtime shape errors on CPU.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="arch-card">
        <div class="arch-card-num">03 &middot; Fast Sampling</div>
        <span class="arch-card-icon">🚀</span>
        <div class="arch-card-name">Latent Consistency Models</div>
        <div class="arch-card-tech">LCM-LoRA &middot; 4-step denoising</div>
        <div class="arch-card-desc">Reduces inference from 50 DDIM steps to 4. Thermal management protocol inserts 10&thinsp;s cooldown between runs to prevent CPU frequency throttling on the passive-cooled i3.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="arch-card">
        <div class="arch-card-num">04 &middot; 3D Recovery</div>
        <span class="arch-card-icon">🗺️</span>
        <div class="arch-card-name">DPT-Hybrid MiDaS</div>
        <div class="arch-card-tech">Intel/dpt-hybrid-midas &middot; transformers pipeline</div>
        <div class="arch-card-desc">Monocular depth estimation on generated textures. np.gradient() computes &part;z/&part;x and &part;z/&part;y, stacked into unit-normal vectors and encoded as RGB (0&ndash;255).</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="pipeline">
        <div class="pipe-step"><div class="pipe-num">01</div><div class="pipe-line"></div><div class="pipe-body"><div class="pipe-title">Text Prompt</div><div class="pipe-sub">Biological description of iris state, pupil dilation, pigmentation, lighting context.</div></div></div>
        <div class="pipe-step"><div class="pipe-num">02</div><div class="pipe-line"></div><div class="pipe-body"><div class="pipe-title">OpenVINO Pipeline Load</div><div class="pipe-sub">OVStableDiffusionPipeline.from_pretrained() &rarr; reshape() &rarr; compile()</div></div></div>
        <div class="pipe-step"><div class="pipe-num">03</div><div class="pipe-line"></div><div class="pipe-body"><div class="pipe-title">LCM Denoising (4 steps)</div><div class="pipe-sub">512&times;512 latent space &rarr; image. Thermal cooldown (10&thinsp;s) between iterations.</div></div></div>
        <div class="pipe-step"><div class="pipe-num">04</div><div class="pipe-line"></div><div class="pipe-body"><div class="pipe-title">Depth Estimation</div><div class="pipe-sub">DPT-Hybrid MiDaS infers per-pixel depth map from generated iris PNG.</div></div></div>
        <div class="pipe-step"><div class="pipe-num">05</div><div class="pipe-line"></div><div class="pipe-body"><div class="pipe-title">Normal Map Extraction</div><div class="pipe-sub">np.gradient() &rarr; surface normals &rarr; RGB PNG. strength param scales depth gradient.</div></div></div>
        <div class="pipe-step"><div class="pipe-num">06</div><div class="pipe-line" style="background:transparent"></div><div class="pipe-body"><div class="pipe-title">Output</div><div class="pipe-sub">Iris texture + Normal Map saved to experiments/. CLI: ocular-generate, ocular-stress.</div></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" style="background:var(--bg2)">
  <div class="sec-eyebrow">Source</div>
  <div class="sec-heading">Core API</div>
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.5rem;">
    <div class="code-wrap">
      <div class="code-head">
        <div class="code-dots"><div class="cd cd-r"></div><div class="cd cd-y"></div><div class="cd cd-g"></div></div>
        <div class="code-fname">src/ocular_core/generator.py</div>
      </div>
      <div class="code-body"><span class="c"># OpenVINO-optimized iris generator</span>
<span class="k">from</span> <span class="t">optimum.intel.openvino</span> <span class="k">import</span> <span class="fn">OVStableDiffusionPipeline</span>

<span class="k">def</span> <span class="fn">generate_iris</span>(<span class="w">output_path</span>, <span class="w">prompt</span>):
  <span class="c"># Load FP16 quantized OpenVINO model</span>
  <span class="w">pipe</span> = <span class="fn">OVStableDiffusionPipeline</span>.from_pretrained(
    <span class="s">"OpenVINO/stable-diffusion-v1-5-fp16-ov"</span>,
    compile=<span class="k">False</span>
  )
  <span class="c"># Pin shape before compile</span>
  <span class="w">pipe</span>.reshape(batch_size=<span class="t">1</span>, height=<span class="t">512</span>,
               width=<span class="t">512</span>, num_images_per_prompt=<span class="t">1</span>)
  <span class="w">pipe</span>.to(<span class="s">"cpu"</span>); <span class="w">pipe</span>.compile()

  <span class="w">image</span> = <span class="w">pipe</span>(
    prompt=<span class="w">prompt</span>,
    negative_prompt=<span class="s">"blurry, drawing, painting"</span>,
    num_inference_steps=<span class="t">20</span>, height=<span class="t">512</span>, width=<span class="t">512</span>
  ).images[<span class="t">0</span>]
  <span class="w">image</span>.save(<span class="w">output_path</span>)</div>
    </div>
    <div class="code-wrap">
      <div class="code-head">
        <div class="code-dots"><div class="cd cd-r"></div><div class="cd cd-y"></div><div class="cd cd-g"></div></div>
        <div class="code-fname">src/ocular_core/texture.py</div>
      </div>
      <div class="code-body"><span class="c"># DPT-Hybrid MiDaS normal map extraction</span>
<span class="k">import</span> <span class="t">numpy</span> <span class="k">as</span> <span class="t">np</span>
<span class="k">from</span> <span class="t">transformers</span> <span class="k">import</span> <span class="fn">pipeline</span>

<span class="w">depth_estimator</span> = <span class="fn">pipeline</span>(
  task=<span class="s">"depth-estimation"</span>,
  model=<span class="s">"Intel/dpt-hybrid-midas"</span>
)

<span class="k">def</span> <span class="fn">extract_normal_map</span>(<span class="w">img_path</span>, <span class="w">save_path</span>, strength=<span class="t">0.5</span>):
  <span class="w">depth</span> = <span class="w">depth_estimator</span>(<span class="fn">Image</span>.open(<span class="w">img_path</span>))[<span class="s">"depth"</span>]
  <span class="w">d</span> = <span class="fn">np</span>.array(<span class="w">depth</span>).astype(<span class="s">"float64"</span>)
  <span class="w">zy</span>, <span class="w">zx</span> = <span class="fn">np</span>.gradient(<span class="w">d</span>)      <span class="c"># surface gradients</span>
  <span class="w">zx</span> *= <span class="w">strength</span>; <span class="w">zy</span> *= <span class="w">strength</span>
  <span class="w">normal</span> = <span class="fn">np</span>.dstack((-<span class="w">zx</span>, -<span class="w">zy</span>, <span class="fn">np</span>.ones_like(<span class="w">d</span>)))
  <span class="w">normal</span> /= <span class="fn">np</span>.linalg.norm(<span class="w">normal</span>, axis=<span class="t">2</span>, keepdims=<span class="k">True</span>)
  <span class="w">rgb</span> = ((<span class="w">normal</span> + <span class="t">1</span>) / <span class="t">2</span> * <span class="t">255</span>).astype(<span class="fn">np</span>.uint8)
  <span class="fn">Image</span>.fromarray(<span class="w">rgb</span>).save(<span class="w">save_path</span>)</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

